          <Pad Id="QB1IiCyIp5oxAK9G7KKO3f" Bounds="1040,100,330,45" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="the map side hears through ITS OWN Console -&gt; MouseState: pixel coordinates, which is what ScreenToWorld expects. The left window keeps its Skia Mouse and canvas units - same cursor, two coordinate systems, two different numbers.">
