          <Pad Id="UBqYgYUfQdQtSk4i3F9QBz" Bounds="990,220,380,45" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt;- FrameDelay breaks a genuine loop: the point is built FROM the map (ScreenToWorld) and drawn ON it (Layers). The layer the map gets is one frame old - no eye can see that. Tutorial 08 explains this wall properly.">
